", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0aS5yYz9DNYQ7kNvwEC-Ws4&_nc_oc=AdpefsS_i-c0xZLsDDJOU8JOQ1FK7eAC9h7Beda6z2HFXJ6gDT_kgcKDPC04lnp7aS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5c1PKjJ7BlxGKn8uAc3NfgeL2z2R_Uu7vyqt9t-o-z2w&oe=69F9F2F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SauGx9TQ1g0Q7kNvwFI5zIL&_nc_oc=AdoLwne8QQlOssyfsT1dRFNxLSxAKNtSzCprZWShwOHmVdU9SKnLDy1hVjNsQ_LQbYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6rIbhVuWfGyILg8ACXOWgRlyv_SI3G_I60sFROyNDO-A&oe=69FA09CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d7RjxiwzT7sQ7kNvwEfnCbd&_nc_oc=AdrTVhJWmE4mTQYQ1WNLrr1febj8XUnBoBAwadSXD6j3rpBUWXjNgs6D2L_6CN3uLxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5W-GPgvdsyD2MOcwPYDVMhRkKvkPXVT1xhapVvUnSjJA&oe=69FA084E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel